{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794324316468,"sessionID":"ses_e3a033ea2ffeKJvy4pS94Xaqs0","part":{"id":"prt_1c610410c001P671RZblXqPIu9","messageID":"msg_1c60ef5d5001gFSg5lInrViSjR","sessionID":"ses_e3a033ea2ffeKJvy4pS94Xaqs0","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794324316468,"sessionID":"ses_e3a033ea2ffeKJvy4pS94Xaqs0","part":{"id":"prt_1c6104114001lE8b2jSnfgrfhh","messageID":"msg_1c60ef5d5001gFSg5lInrViSjR","sessionID":"ses_e3a033ea2ffeKJvy4pS94Xaqs0","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a restaurant table-reservation app: Flask JSON API under `/api` plus React/TypeScript/Vite frontend, per the detailed spec (auth, 20-seat slot capacity, availability, own-reservation CRUD, admin listing/pagination).\n- Backend serves the API and `frontend/dist` on port 8000 from the workspace `Dockerfile`; SQLite data persists under `./data`.\n\n## Important Details\n- API contract: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 `{\"token\":...}`), `POST/GET /api/reservations`, `GET/PUT/DELETE /api/reservations/{id}`, `GET /api/availability?date=`, `GET /api/admin/reservations?date=&page=&page_size=`, `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- Reservation JSON keys are exactly `id, name, email, date, time, party_size, notes, created_at` (no extra fields — deliberately omit `username` from admin items).\n- List shapes: reservations `{\"items\":[...],\"total\":n}`; availability `{\"items\":[{time,booked,remaining}]}`; admin `{\"items\":[...],\"total\",\"page\",\"page_size\"}`.\n- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 without valid token; other users' reservations → 404 (behave as non-existent); non-admin on admin endpoint → 403.\n- Admin: username `admin` is blocked from registration (409); login compares plaintext env `ADMIN_PASSWORD` read at app start; unset/empty → admin login 401 \"Admin sign-in is disabled\".\n- Capacity: 20 guests/slot; refusal → 409 with message containing \"full\" (`\"This time slot is full\"` or `\"This time slot is full: only N seats remaining\"`); PUT excludes own reservation id from the sum (own guests not counted twice).\n- PUT semantics chosen: missing `name/email/date/time/party_size` fall back to existing values; omitted/`null`/empty `notes` → cleared (`null`).\n- DELETE returns 200 `{\"status\":\"cancelled\"}` (chosen over 204 so `r.json()` works).\n- Validation: date strict `YYYY-MM-DD` + valid calendar; time `HH:MM` (optional `:SS`) stored as given; party_size int ≥1 (strings coerced, bools rejected); name/email required non-empty (no format check).\n- Admin defaults: `page=1`, `page_size=50`, max 1000; invalid non-integer → 400.\n- Concurrency: SQLite `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` transactions + WAL; verified with 35 concurrent bookings → exactly 20×201, 15×409.\n- Environment: no docker; Python 3.13.5, Node v24.22.1; venv at `/workspace/.venv` (deps installed); npm registry is local proxy `http://172.30.98.2:4873` (reachable); writes outside `/workspace` blocked by permission rules.\n- Gunicorn run command: `cd /workspace && /workspace/.venv/bin/gunicorn --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app --daemon --pid /workspace/.gunicorn.pid --error-logfile /workspace/.gunicorn.log`.\n- Frontend deps decided: `tailwindcss@4.3.5` + `@tailwindcss/vite@4.3.5` (peer allows vite ^8), `typescript@5.9.3` (avoid TS 7), `@types/react@19.3.0`, `@types/react-dom@19.3.0`; build script is `\"build\": \"tsc --noEmit && vite build\"` (typecheck must pass for Docker build).\n- Styling: Tailwind utility classes only; single CSS entry `frontend/src/index.css` with `@import \"tailwindcss\";`. No emojis in UI.\n- UI structure: signed out → AuthPanel + public AvailabilityPanel; signed in → tabs (Availability, Book a table, My reservations, + Admin only for `admin` username); header shows \"Signed in as {username}\" + Sign out; cancel uses `window.confirm`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Read workspace scaffold: `Dockerfile`, `README.md`, `backend/app.py` (skeleton), `backend/requirements.txt` (`flask==3.1.3`, `gunicorn==26.2.0`), `frontend/package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `index.html`, `src/{main.tsx,App.tsx}`.\n- Rewrote `/workspace/backend/app.py` as full API: SQLite schema (users/tokens/reservations) at `data/reservations.db`, token auth decorator, register/login (incl. admin), reservations CRUD with transactional capacity checks, availability, admin pagination, JSON 404/405 for `/api/*`, SPA catch-all serving `frontend/dist`, `init_db()` at import, `DATA_DIR` env override (default `data`).\n- Backend tests pass: `/workspace/api_test.py` MODE=basic → `{\"failures\": []}` (exit 0) and MODE=admin → `{\"failures\": []}` (exit 0) after restart with `ADMIN_PASSWORD=adminpw`.\n- Concurrency test passed: `{'201': 20, '409': 15, ...}` \"concurrency OK\" (script `/workspace/conc_test.py`).\n- Frontend scaffolding written: `frontend/package.json` (deps above), `frontend/vite.config.ts` (adds `tailwindcss()` plugin), `frontend/tsconfig.json` (strict, `noEmit`, `verbatimModuleSyntax`, `noUnusedLocals`), `frontend/src/index.css`, `frontend/src/types.ts`, `frontend/src/api.ts` (`ApiError`, `api<T>()`, localStorage session helpers), `frontend/src/ui.ts` (shared Tailwind class constants + `todayISO`/`shiftDay`/`formatDay`).\n- Components written: `src/components/DayPicker.tsx`, `AuthPanel.tsx`, `AvailabilityPanel.tsx` (fixed two unused locals), `BookingForm.tsx`, `MyReservations.tsx`, `AdminPanel.tsx`; `src/App.tsx` rewritten (tabs, session state, availability/reservations fetch + refresh); `src/main.tsx` imports `./index.css`; `index.html` title → \"Table reservations\".\n\n### Active\n- Frontend source complete but unverified: dependencies not yet installed (`npm install` not run), `package-lock.json` not yet regenerated, `tsc --noEmit` and `vite build` not yet executed.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run `cd /workspace/frontend && npm install` to install tailwind/typescript deps and regenerate `frontend/package-lock.json`, then `npm run build` (runs `tsc --noEmit && vite build`) and fix any type errors.\n2. Restart backend with fresh data (`kill $(cat /workspace/.gunicorn.pid); rm -rf /workspace/data` + gunicorn start), verify `GET /` serves the built SPA and API still passes `python3 /workspace/api_test.py`; then clean up dev artifacts (`api_test.py`, `conc_test.py`, `.gunicorn.pid`, `.gunicorn.log`, test `data/`, consider `.gitignore` for `.venv`/`data`) and do a final spec-compliance review.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API (auth, reservations, availability, admin, capacity, SPA serving) — main backend deliverable.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`: updated deps/build scripts; lock file still needs regeneration.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy to `localhost:8000`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`: strict typecheck config used by `npm run build`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: root component — session, tabs, availability/reservations fetching, refresh wiring.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/*.tsx`: AuthPanel, AvailabilityPanel, BookingForm, MyReservations, AdminPanel, DayPicker.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`, `src/types.ts`, `src/ui.ts`: API client, response types, shared Tailwind classes/date helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: Tailwind entry (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`) — only allowed CSS file.\n- `/workspace/api_test.py`, `/workspace/conc_test.py`: dev-only test scripts to remove before finishing.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `npm ci`, gunicorn `app:app`, `./data` persistence).","time":{"start":1794324316436,"end":1794324316440}}}
